4.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-06T20:00:01Z"},"body":"Contributes to #43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `SpinBox` covering:\r\n\r\n* `get_line_edit()` and default `Range` values (`value`, `min`, `max`, `step`, `allow_greater` / `allow_lesser` off)\r\n* Clamping to `max` and values beyond `max` when `allow_greater` is enabled; clamping to `min` and values below `min` when `allow_lesser` is enabled\r\n* `prefix` / `suffix` appearing in the inner `LineEdit` text after parenting to the scene tree and `process(0)` (substring checks; value asserted separately to avoid locale-specific digit formatting)\r\n* Delegation to the inner line edit: `horizontal_alignment`, `editable`, `select_all_on_focus`\r\n* `update_on_text_changed` getter/setter, deferred `text_changed` connection, and `process(0)` after enabling\r\n* `apply()` parsing an expression (`10+5` → value) and leaving the value unchanged when the expression is invalid\r\n* `custom_arrow_step` / `custom_arrow_round` getters and setters\r\n* `get_combined_minimum_size()` strictly positive width and height in-tree after `process(0)`\r\n\r\nFork CI: workflow tests completed successfully on [`calbebop/godot`](https://github.com/calbebop/godot) for branch `add-spin-box-unit-tests`.\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote every line, reviewed the changes, and ran pre-commit. Cursor helped with research and drafting.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions"